3. WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER
-----------------------------------

The site is a mixed collection. These items keep their own rights and terms,
and are used here with attribution rather than re-licensed:

  - Diagnostic criteria and codes, summarised from DSM-5, published by the
    American Psychiatric Association. The manual's wording belongs to the APA.
  - Teaching material contributed by the instructors named in review/intake.md,
    reproduced with their separate permission. That permission, not this file,
    is what covers those sections.
  - Books, films and clinical guidelines, which are named by title in the
    reading lists and are not reproduced.
  - Statistics and datasets from the National Mental Health Survey, Nepal
    Police, the Ministry of Health, the World Health Organization, and the
    Institute for Health Metrics and Evaluation. Reproduced as numbers with
    attribution.
  - Government emblems and the National Mental Health Survey logo. Used for
    identification only, under the respective guidelines.


4. NO WARRANTY, AND NO ADVICE
----------------------------

The site is educational material. It is not medical, psychological, or legal
advice, and it is not a diagnostic tool. It is provided as is, without
warranty of any kind, and without any promise that it is accurate, complete,
or current.

Figures on each page carry the source and the year. Where a figure is a model
rather than a measurement, or where no figure exists, the page says so.

If you are in crisis, contact a health professional or an emergency service
rather than relying on this site. Helpline numbers are listed on every page.


